            "description": "[confidence=high, sources=static] The malware string 'shadowcopy' was found in the binary. This string is characteristic of Inhibit System Recovery behavior. The presence of this specific string alone (no other Inhibit System Recovery-related string corroborates it) indicates the malware has capabilities associated with this technique, but with less certainty than a corroborated combination would.",
